<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 21.</p>
<p>				    May 21/May 20   May 21/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.08		 6.48</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 4.75</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.30		 8.69</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.10		55.52</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.30		30.65</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.31		31.44</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.71		 9.15</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.07		20.89</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.37		37.30</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.34		36.17</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.46		16.04</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.98		84.14</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,221,777,759,357</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,904,385,227,019</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,000,259,110,684</p>
<p>  International funds			    91,224,847,230</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    225,908,574,424</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
